WEBVTT

00:00:11.999 --> 00:00:14.045
[♪♪♪]

00:00:16.873 --> 00:00:18.353
[BIRD CHIRPING]

00:00:46.555 --> 00:00:48.688
[CABINET SHUTS]

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.232
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:25.029
[RATTLING, BIRD CHIRPING]

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:46.093
[SOBBING]

00:01:59.106 --> 00:02:03.023
Stop it, Ron.
You're making it snow.

00:02:07.332 --> 00:02:10.117
Tell me how I broke up
with Lavender again.

00:02:10.161 --> 00:02:12.859
HERMIONE:
Um, well,

00:02:12.902 --> 00:02:17.690
s-she came to visit you
in the hospital.

00:02:17.733 --> 00:02:20.258
And you talked.

00:02:21.737 --> 00:02:23.087
I don't believe it was

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.306
a particularly
long conversation.

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:26.525
Don't get me wrong,

00:02:26.568 --> 00:02:28.701
I'm bloody thrilled
to be shot of her.

00:02:28.744 --> 00:02:31.312
It's just she seems
a bit put out.

00:02:38.972 --> 00:02:41.757
Yes, she does,
doesn't she?

00:02:43.194 --> 00:02:48.590
You say you don't remember
anything from that night?

00:02:48.634 --> 00:02:51.767
Anything at all?

00:02:51.811 --> 00:02:53.987
There is something.

00:02:57.164 --> 00:02:59.427
But it can't be.

00:02:59.471 --> 00:03:01.734
I was completely boggled,
wasn't I?

00:03:02.387 --> 00:03:03.736
HERMIONE:
Right.

00:03:03.779 --> 00:03:06.956
Boggled.

00:03:13.572 --> 00:03:15.008
Harry.

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:17.576
That's Katie.

00:03:19.143 --> 00:03:21.493
Katie Bell.

00:03:28.717 --> 00:03:31.198
Katie. How are you?

00:03:31.242 --> 00:03:33.940
I know you're going to ask,
Harry,

00:03:33.983 --> 00:03:36.377
but I don't know who cursed me.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:42.688
I've been trying to remember,
honestly,

00:03:42.731 --> 00:03:45.386
but I just can't.

00:03:50.565 --> 00:03:52.350
[♪♪♪]

00:03:58.530 --> 00:04:00.009
Katie?

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.643
[WATER RUNNING]

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.914
[SOBBING]

00:04:42.313 --> 00:04:45.620
HARRY:
I know what you did, Malfoy.
You hexed her, didn't you?

00:04:49.711 --> 00:04:51.060
[GRUNTS]

00:04:53.106 --> 00:04:54.499
[WATER SPRAYING]

00:05:16.477 --> 00:05:19.263
Sectumsempra!

00:05:25.007 --> 00:05:26.531
[DRACO GASPING]

00:06:05.744 --> 00:06:08.834
SNAPE:
Vulnera Sanentur.

00:06:10.357 --> 00:06:13.317
Vulnera Sanentur.

00:06:15.449 --> 00:06:18.583
Vulnera Sanentur.

00:06:20.236 --> 00:06:21.803
Vulnera Sanentur...

